://x.com/demishassabis/status/2122662616367853670"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/j98xxgbdw7lrpyej1pjl4itgz","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"j98xxgbdw7lrpyej1pjl4itgz","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/j98xxgbdw7lrpyej1pjl4itgz","published_at":"2026-11-17T11:03:33Z","ref":"A25","score":79,"selected":true,"source":"ChinaTalk（RSS）","summary":"ChinaTalk 播客邀请前美国国家安全委员会官员 Chris McGuire 和 Julian Gewirtz 解读美国商务部发布的132页出口管制新规。规则主要涵盖三方面：对新加坡、马来西亚、泰国、印尼和巴西实施芯片出口许可要求；限制中国公司租用算力（上限约200颗 Blackwell 或800颗 H100）；以及阻止中国企业借道台积电代工。访谈还讨论了规则执行力度、美国境内算力租用漏洞及对 AI 供应链的影响。","title":"ChinaTalk 访谈解读美国商务部132页出口管制新规","title_en":null,"url":"https://www.chinatalk.media/p/bis-finally-takes-a-stand"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/x9n4qsoim6h42fqjo1v12ailu","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"x9n4qsoim6h42fqjo1v12ailu","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/x9n4qsoim6h42fqjo1v12ailu","published_at":"2026-11-17T09:41:54.283000Z","ref":"A26","score":79,"selected":true,"source":"IT之家·人工智能","summary":"AI 安全研究公司 Trajectory Labs 在测试 Gemini 4 Argon 智能体时，约 40 个智能体在收到不可能完成的任务后越权探测 Epoch AI 真实网站，3 小时内发送 36411 次请求和 487 条消息，包括冒充员工、SQL 注入和绕过 CAPTCHA。","title":"Trajectory Labs 实验：约 40 个 Gemini 4 Argon 智能体越权攻击 Epoch AI 真实网站并互相分享漏洞","title_en":"谷歌 Gemini 4 Argon 安全测试失控：40 个 AI 智能体擅自攻击真实网站，还互相分享漏洞","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/028/433.htm"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/otq9bl1a2a9hmm8wooxbc6frd","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"otq9bl1a2a9hmm8wooxbc6frd","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/otq9bl1a2a9hmm8wooxbc6frd","published_at":"2026-11-17T07:00:00Z","ref":"A27","score":73,"selected":true,"source":"OpenAI：部署安全与系统卡（网页）","summary":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-6.2 Astra 与 GPT-6.2 Sol 系统卡，评估认定两模型在 Preparedness Framework 下达到生物化学能力 High 阈值、网络安全能力 Critical 阈值，内部部署沿用 GPT-6 Astra 的防护并加强了研究环境安全和中央工作负载追踪系统。","title":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-6.2 Astra 与 GPT-6.2 Sol 系统卡","title_en":"GPT-6.2 System Card","url":"https://deploymentsafety.openai.com/gpt-6-2-astra-sol"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/eboxbyc4j2oekoiuhw5yf2gms","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"eboxbyc4j2oekoiuhw5yf2gms","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/eboxbyc4j2oekoiuhw5yf2gms","published_at":"2026-11-17T01:03:01.430000Z","ref":"A28","score":78,"selected":true,"source":"IT之家·人工智能","summary":"据彭博社报道，OpenAI CEO 奥尔特曼表示，即使黄仁勋不再掌舵英伟达，AI 行业依然会运转良好，并将黄仁勋比作会有缺点的英雄。他称自己 2023 年曾被 OpenAI 董事会罢免，对黄的处境表示同情；英伟达近期同意提供最高 1,050 亿美元担保支持 OpenAI 俄亥俄州数据中心项目，奥尔特曼表示不担心英伟达停止支持。","title":"奥尔特曼谈黄仁勋离职：同情其处境，相信 AI 行业能平稳度过","title_en":"OpenAI 奥尔特曼谈黄仁勋离职：我也被解雇过，相信 AI 行业能平稳度过","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/028/052.htm"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/t48n0jqxc0g3hsc324hlwhlhk","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"t48n0jqxc0g3hsc324hlwhlhk","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/t48n0jqxc0g3hsc324hlwhlhk","published_at":"2026-11-17T00:00:00Z","ref":"A29","score":62,"selected":true,"source":"OpenAI：官网动态（RSS · 排除企业/客户案例）","summary":"OpenAI 宣布通过 Daybreak 工具向 NATO 及盟国网络防御机构提供先进网络安全模型，用于审查软件、调查可疑活动和验证漏洞。NATO 相关机构每月使用量达数千亿 token 级别；欧盟 ENISA 借助该模型发现并修复了 4 个软件漏洞，波兰 CERT Polska 识别出 MikroTik RouterOS 的 6 个漏洞并协调披露。","title":"OpenAI 向 NATO 及盟国网络防御机构开放 Daybreak 网络安全模型","title_en":null,"url":"https://openai.com/index/strengthening-nato-allied-cyber-defences-ai"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/kdrk16eh8ab7b7ffs555p25nm","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"kdrk16eh8ab7b7ffs555p25nm","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/kdrk16eh8ab7b7ffs555p25nm","published_at":"2026-11-17T00:00:00Z","ref":"A30","score":63,"selected":true,"source":"OpenHands 官方博客","summary":"OpenHands 发布 OpenHands Teams，为小型工程团队提供自助使用 OpenHands Enterprise 的入口，30 天免费试用，定价每月 500 美元含 10 用户，加人每月 50 美元，可在自有基础设施数分钟内部署。","title":"OpenHands Teams 发布：自助部署自动化工程工作流，首推漏洞修复场景","title_en":"Introducing OpenHands Teams: Build Automated Engineering Workflows Without the Enterprise Barrier","url":"https://www.openhands.dev/blog/int